       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          SEARQADD.
       AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        9/14/87.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.
      *D   ELECTRONIC APPROVAL SYSTEM - ADD/MOD/CREATE REQ:
      *D   THIS IS FOR NON-STOREROOM, NON-MMIS REQUISITIONS.
      *C
      *C   05/05/94  JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 94-001/SLS REQ 6487
      *C     ADDED THE ABILITY TO ALLOW 'SS' STATUS REQUISITIONS
      *C     THAT HAVE THE AUTHORIZATION FLAG SET VIA MP1 TO BE
      *C     HANDLED.
      *C
      *C   FEB. 1995 JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 94-041/SLS #6558
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW A CHECK OF MVALIDPLTDATA TO DETERMINE
      *C     IF THE DEPARTMENT ENTERED BY THE USER ON THE REQUISITION
      *C     WAS ONE THAT WAS DESIGNATED AS A DEPARTMENT FOR WHICH
      *C     REQUISITIONS ARE TO BE EXPLODED (I.E. THE DEPARTMENT
      *C     ENTERED TRIGGERS REQUISITIONS FOR OTHER DEPARTMENTS).
      *C
      *C   OCT/NOV 1995 JE COFFMAN
      *C     INCORPORATED NEW LOGIC TO NOT ALLOW AN "EXPLODE FROM"
      *C     DEPARTMENT TO BE VALID EXCEPT IF THE USER IS FLAGGED
      *C     AS CAPABLE OF EXPLODING REQUISITIONS.
      *C
      *C   APR 1996     JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED CODE TO NOT ALLOW AN EXPLODE DEPARTMENT TO BE
      *C     ENTERED ON A MODIFY OF A REQUISITION.
      *C
      *C   15APR1996    DAVE PLUM
      *C     MODIFIED THE LOGIC ADDED ON 11APR1996 TO ONLY DISALLOW
      *C     THE ENTRY OF "EXPLODED DEPARTMENTS" (KEY = ED**** IN
      *C     MVALIDPLTDATA (WHERE "****" IS THE DEPT NUMBER).  WE DO
      *C     WANT TO ALLOW REQUISITIONS TO BE MODIFIED TO ONE OF THE
      *C     DEPT VALUES THAT THE "ED***" DEPT IS EXPLODED TO.  FOR
      *C     EXAMPLE, IF THE KEY "ED1579" EXISTS IN MVALIDPLTDATA
      *C     WITH THE V-E-D VALUES "1517" AND "1519", THEN A REQ
      *C     SHOULD NOT BE MODIFIED TO DEPT 1579.  IT CAN, HOWEVER,
      *C     BE MODIFIED TO DEPT 1517 OR DEPT 1519.
      *C
      *C
      *C   SEPTEMBER 1996 JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C     EXPANDED DATE FIELDS TO YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     INCLUDED IS THE REQUIRED DATE PASSED TO CMANREQ.
      *C
      *C   DECEMBER 1996  CA YODER    REQ# 96-027
      *C     ADDED NEW FIELDS TO DREQITM DATASET AND TO THE
      *C     REQ ADD/MODIFY SCREENS TO SHOW CURRENCY CODE.
      *C     IF A VALUE IS ENTERED IN THE "OTHER CURRENCY" FIELD,
      *C     THE VALUE IS CONVERTED INTO THE HOME CURRENCY AND
      *C     STORED IN THE UNIT-PRICE FIELD IN DREQITM.  THE OTHER
      *C     CURRENCY VALUE AND CODE ARE THEN STORED IN THE
      *C     TWO NEW FIELDS ADDED TO DREQITM.
      *C
      *C   DECEMBER 1996  CA YODER    REQ#96-040
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO VALIDATE COMPANY AND PRIME ON THE
      *C     REQUISITION.  ALSO CORRECTED HOW CLASS IS VALIDATED.
      *C     IT WAS USING MVALIDPLTDATA, BUT IT WAS CHANGED TO
      *C     USE MCLASS.
      *C
      *C   MARCH 1997     JE COFFMAN  REQ# 96-045
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW THE USER TO LINK A REQUISITION
      *C     TO A WORK ORDER. THIS REQUIRES THAT WE CREATE A
      *C     WO-PARTS RECORD ON THE MMIS SIDE.
      *C
      *C   OCTOBER 1997   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK IF DOCK NOTIFY USERID IS REQUIRED
      *C     AND THAT THE ENTERED USERID IS A VALID SYSTEM USERID.
      *C
      *C   NOVEMBER 5, 1997 JEFF BUNGO
      *C     DEFAULT NOTIFY USERID ON REQUISITION ADD TO THE USERID
      *C     FOUND FOR THE CLOCK CARD ENTERED.
      *C
      *C   02FEB1998  WL MCINTYRE
      *C     REVISE PROGRAM TO PASS "M" FOR MODIFY OR "D" FOR DELETE
      *C     TO THE EDIT SUBPROGRAM CEAEDIT.  PREVIOUSLY, A "M" WAS
      *C     PASSED TO THE CEAEDIT FOR BOTH MODIFY AND DELETE REQUESTS.
      *C
      *C   02FEB1998  JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED PROGRAM LOGIC TO SET A NEW SWITCH (CMR-MREQFILE-FLAG)
      *C     WHICH WILL TELL CMANREQ THAT A USER HAS MODIFIED A "M"
      *C     REQUISITIONED ITEM AND CHANGED THE CORPORATE CODE VALUE
      *C     FROM 'NON-STR' TO A LEGITIMATE CORPORATE CODE. THE NEWLY
      *C     CREATED REQS INDICATED THAT THEY WERE IN MATERIALS CONTROL
      *C     BUT COULD NOT BE PROCESSED AS THERE WAS NO MREQFILE ENTRY
      *C     FOR THE CODE/REQUISITION COMBINATION THAT MA1 COULD USE.
      *C
      *C   20OCT1998  JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED A CHECK PRIOR TO CALL TO SMREQINQ TO VALIDATE THAT
      *C     THE USER CLOCK CARD IS ALLOWED TO FREELY LOOK AT SYSTEM
      *C     REQS.
      *C
      *C   20JAN2000  JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO EDIT CHECK THE CLASS ENTRY FOR TYLER PER
      *C     JIM RUSH'S VERBAL REQUEST.
      *C
      *C   22MAR2000  JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED AN EDIT CHECK TO THE PROGRAM TO HANDLE A SITUATION
      *C     WHERE AN 'M' REQUISITION WAS CREATED FOR A CORPORATE CODE
      *C     BUT THE ORIGINATOR REALIZED THAT THE WRONG CODE HAD BEEN
      *C     ENTERED AND MODIFIED THE REQUISITION TO THE CORRECT CODE.
      *C     THE REQUISITION WAS GETTING "HUNG' IIN MATERIAL CONTROL
      *C     BECAUSE THE MREQFILE ENTRY WRITTEN ORIGINALLY FOR THE
      *C     CODE WAS NOT GETTING ALTERED.
      *C
      *C   15DEC2000  JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED CALL TO CHECKBOOK PROGRAM PXBVA006 VIA FUNCTION KEY
      *C     F6 WHEN CREATING REQS (GADSDEN REQUEST). THE INTENT IS SO
      *C     USERS CAN BETTER MONITOR THE DOLLARS THAT ARE ACCRUING
      *C     FOR THEIR TEAM/LOCATIONS.
      *C
      *C   16JAN2001  JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED LOGIC AT STEVE STEPP'S REQUEST IN TYLER TO MAKE
      *C     EXPENSE CLASS A REQUIRED FIELD.
      *C
      *C   11DEC2001  BE GEISER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC AT JIM THOMAS'S REQUEST TO MAKE UNIT OF MEASURE
      *C     A REQUIRED FIELD FOR SAP/R3 PLANTS. ALSO, CHECK MPLTINFO
      *C     SYNR3 SWITCH TO DETERMINE IF PLANT IS USING SAP/R3 TO AVOID
      *C     MAINTAINING A HARD-CODED LIST OF SAP/R3 PLANTS.
      *C
      *C   21JAN2002  BE GEISER
      *C     FORCE VALID UNIT OF MEASURE ON REQ MODIFY FUNCTION FOR
      *C     SAP/R3 PLANTS. INCLUDES CODED AND NON CODED ITEMS.
      *C
      *C   04APR2002  CA YODER
      *C     FOR SAP/R3 PLANTS, FORCE STOREROOM REQS TO GO ON APPROVAL
      *C     PATH BY USING STR-AUTH-FLAG.
      *C
      *C   23APR2002  CA YODER
      *C     FOR SAP/R3 PLANTS, CHANGE ADDITIONAL INFO FIELD TO BE THE
      *C     SAP INTERNAL ORDER NUMBER.  VALIDATE THE ENTRY AGAINST
      *C     "NW" ENTRY IN MVALIDPLTDATA.
      *C
      *C     ALSO HAD TO CREATE NEW FIELDS FOR SEVERAL OF THE HEADINGS
      *C     ON THE E1 SCREEN.  THE HEADINGS ARE NOW VARIABLE, DEPENDING
      *C     ON WHICH PLANT SWITCHES ARE SET.
      *C
      *C   16MAY03  BE GEISER
      *C     ADD FIELD TO SCREEN TO IDENTIFY SERVICE REQS. THIS WILL
      *C     BE PASSED OVER TO SAP. ADD MANF NAME/PART TO FIRST LINE
      *C     OF COMMENTS (LAWTON REQUEST).
      *C
      *C   16JUL03  BE GEISER
      *C     RESTRICT MANF NAME/PART COMMENT OVERLAY TO LAWTON ONLY.
      *C
      *C   10SEP03  BE GEISER
      *C     ADD REPAIR & RETURN OPTION IN ADDTION TO SERVICE AND
      *C     MATERIAL REQS.
      *C
      *C   15MAR2004  H PROCTOR
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO NOT CALL PROGRAM PXBVA006 WHEN FUNCTION KEY
      *C     F6 IS PRESSED IF THE PLANT IS RUNNING SAP R3.
      *C
      *C   08JUL2004  GEISER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW CALL FROM PROGRAM TMODMATL. THAT IS
      *C     THE MMIS WORK ORDER REQUISITION CREATE PROGRAM. SAP REQUEST.
      *C
      *C   JULY 2004  GEISER
      *C     DEFAULT UM TO STORES BASE UM IF NOT ENTERED.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MCLASS-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MVALIDPLTDATA-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MVALIDUM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQITM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2202
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MREQ-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2001
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT PER-PERSONNEL-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZEAREQ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.


